%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:301 (writeJson-writeAttributes-test)
testing: writeAttributes with nested objects
元の形: io/writeJson の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"_tag": "root", "_attrs": {"version": "1.0"}, "child": {"_tag": "child", "_attrs": {"type": "info"}, "_text": "content"}}, "application/json", {"writeAttributes": true})
%%% output application/json
"{\n  \"_tag\": \"root\",\n  \"_attrs\": {\n    \"version\": \"1.0\"\n  },\n  \"child\": {\n    \"_tag\": \"child\",\n    \"_attrs\": {\n      \"type\": \"info\"\n    },\n    \"_text\": \"content\"\n  }\n}"
